# src/apps/daemon/internal/integrations/captchaclient

## Purpose
External CAPTCHA-solving adapter used by subscription/mobile/product flows.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `integrations` (rank 3; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

## Contents
- Direct files (3): `http_bounds.go`, `solver.go`, `solver_test.go`

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Go package: `captchaclient`.
- Notable exported surface: `CaptchaSolver`, `ExtractSiteKey`, `NewCaptchaSolver`.
- Daemon-local dependencies: `internal/foundation/remoteaction`.
- Direct daemon callers: `internal/adapters/api`, `internal/adapters/mobilebind`, `internal/integrations/sub`.

## Invariants
- `integrations` code must not import a higher-rank daemon band.

